        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-262 (ensure controlled execution — Store Staffing &amp; People (PA-07.4).) | - operational: strict check-in process and requirement for advance scheduling; operational: clear vendor control of promodizer tasks and W449 compliance monitoring
Owner: Department Supervisor</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
